  "reasoning": "The defendant used an unregistered, unlicensed fishing vessel and illegal gear (a prohibited 9mm mesh net) to conduct fishing in a designated prohibited area, capturing a large quantity of fish and earning illegal profit. Under Chinese criminal law, such conduct constitutes the crime of illegal fishing and illegal exploitation of fishery resources (非法捕捞、捕捞渔业资源罪). No other criminal conduct (e.g., theft, fraud, corruption) is present in the facts, so only this charge applies.",
